00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:07.333
- Alergi mâine?
- Da.

00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:09.416
Hai!

00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:17.750
Fugi, Alma!

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:20.291
Ca vântul!

00:05:24.041 --> 00:05:26.583
Aleargă repede, Alma!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.500
